               Update on pa pa_1
               Update on pa_a pa_2
               Update on pa_b pa_3
               ->  Result
                     ->  Append
                           ->  Seq Scan on pa pa_1
                           ->  Seq Scan on pa_a pa_2
                           ->  Seq Scan on pa_b pa_3
 Optimizer: Postgres query optimizer
